    </div>
    <div class="faq reveal d1">
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Do I need prior trading experience?<span class="plus"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>No. Our programs are designed for both complete beginners and experienced traders looking to refine their strategy.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Are classes available online?<span class="plus"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. We offer both online and offline learning, so you can learn from Bhilai in person or from anywhere across India.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">What markets do you teach?<span class="plus"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Stocks, Forex, Cryptocurrency, Commodities and Indices — with a strong foundation in risk management throughout.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Will I receive mentorship?<span class="plus"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Students receive guidance through structured mentoring sessions, and our Professional Mentorship program adds personalised one-on-one support.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Can I join from any city?<span class="plus"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Absolutely. Our online programs and community are available across India, so distance is never a barrier.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

